{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/a-keyed-drag-says-the-key-and-the-time-walk",
  "seed": "The pill under a drag says where the change lands on a layer with keys: a diamond and the playhead time, then the reading (docs/design/mocks/pages/picture-keys.html, Showing that a change will key). At Next defaults, with no flag changed: a layer with no keys reads its size alone; after Add Key and a step along the ruler, a move, a resize and a turn each read the diamond and the time before the size with the button still down.",
